# Line endings: LF in the repository, LF in the working tree.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout leaves CRLF files sitting against LF blobs, so
# every tracked file reports as fully modified and a three-line change arrives as
# a thousand-line diff. That is what made #37 look risky enough to defer for a
# day: the diff could not be reviewed, so the dead route was left in place.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalize these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.sqlite binary
